{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s26-p01",
      "text": "Salt has always been important to people.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p02",
      "text": "In the past, it was as valuable as gold.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p03",
      "text": "People would trade for it.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p04",
      "text": "Over the years, people discovered different ways to get salt.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p05",
      "text": "Depending on the geography, some early people got salt from rocks.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p06",
      "text": "In other places, like on the islands, people got salt from the sea.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p07",
      "text": "They took sea water and put it in the sun.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p08",
      "text": "After a long time, the water dried up.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p09",
      "text": "Then people could get salt.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p09.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p10",
      "text": "Sometimes they would boil the sea water in large pots to get salt faster.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p11",
      "text": "Today, people still get salt from the sea, but most salt comes from salt mines and salt wells.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p12",
      "text": "They dig deep holes into the ground for salt.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p13",
      "text": "They also operate machines to aid themselves.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p14",
      "text": "To get salt from salt wells, people put two pipes into the ground.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p15",
      "text": "Water is sent down through one of the pipes.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p16",
      "text": "And the water is mixed with the salt in salt wells.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p17",
      "text": "It makes salt water.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p18",
      "text": "Then the salt water is pushed up through the other pipe.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p18.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p19",
      "text": "Later, the salt is taken out of the salt water.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p19.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p20",
      "text": "People once worked hard to find and make salt.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p20.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p20.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p21",
      "text": "Now, people can buy it at any food store.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p21.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p21.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p22",
      "text": "Salt is cheap and comes in packets or boxes.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p22.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p22.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p23",
      "text": "It is almost always there in the recipes you download online.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p23.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p23.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p24",
      "text": "You can use it when cooking noodles or making soup.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p24.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p24.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s26-p25",
      "text": "It has become an important part of our everyday lives.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p25.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p25.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
